WineForThai change notice (LGPL-2.1-or-later)
=============================================
File changed: dlls/win32u/font.c
Date:         2026-11-18
Author:       WineForThai project (AI-assisted)
Summary:      Add Thai fonts to the default Tahoma / Microsoft Sans Serif /
              Lucida Sans Unicode SystemLink lists so GDI apps (e.g. LINE)
              render Thai text when a Thai font is present in the prefix.
Base:         Wine staging 11.18 (see AUTHORS.wine, COPYING.LIB).
Upstream:     NOT submitted. The Wine project does not accept AI-generated
              patches, so this change is carried only in WineForThai.

--- 8< --- patch below --- 8< ---
diff --git a/dlls/win32u/font.c b/dlls/win32u/font.c
